    "thm-tdmath-fixed-n-local-ensemble-equivalence": {
      "citations": [
        {
          "fact": "F1",
          "source": "thm-tdmath-canonical-interior-density-limit",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For sequences $L_j\\to\\infty$ and integers $N_j\\geq0$ with $N_j/L_j^d\\to\\rho$, define\n$$b(\\rho)=\\sup\\left\\{\\limsup_{j\\to\\infty}L_j^{-d}\\log Z(L_j,N_j;\\beta):\\frac{N_j}{L_j^d}\\to\\rho\\right\\}.$$\nLet $F$ be the concave envelope of $b$ on $[0,\\infty)$, namely the supremum of $\\sum_{i=1}^m\\theta_i b(\\rho_i)$ over finite lists with $\\theta_i\\geq0$, $\\sum_i\\theta_i=1$, $\\rho_i\\geq0$, and $\\sum_i\\theta_i\\rho_i=\\rho$; the empty supremum is $-\\infty$.",
          "uses": [
            "1.1",
            "2.1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F2",
          "source": "thm-tdmath-canonical-grand-duality",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For $\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$, define\n$$P(\\alpha,\\beta)=\\lim_{L\\to\\infty}L^{-d}\\log\\Xi_L(e^\\alpha,\\beta),$$\nwhose existence is [[thm-tdmath-decreasing-integrable-tail-free-cube-pressure]].",
          "uses": [
            "2.1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F3",
          "source": "thm-tdmath-continuum-variational-pressure",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For free and periodic cubes define\n$$Z_{L,z,\\beta,bc}=E_{Q_{\\Lambda_L}}\\!\\left[z^{N_{\\Lambda_L}}e^{-\\beta H_{L,bc}}\\right],\\qquad bc\\in\\{\\mathrm{free},\\mathrm{per}\\}.$$\nThen the limit $p_Q(z,\\beta)=\\lim_{L\\to\\infty}L^{-d}\\log Z_{L,z,\\beta,bc}$ exists, is independent of $bc$, and\n$$p_Q(z,\\beta)=-\\min_{P\\in\\mathcal P^1_{\\rm stat}}\\{I(P)+\\beta\\Phi(P)-\\rho(P)\\log z\\}.$$\nThe minimizer set is nonempty and compact in the local-tame topology $\\tau_L$.",
          "uses": [
